WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.606
At the bottom of the wide ocean is a world called the Sea Kingdom.

2
00:00:05.607 --> 00:00:09.596
This kingdom lies at the deepest part of the ocean.

3
00:00:09.597 --> 00:00:13.263
It is deeper than any anchor can go.

4
00:00:13.264 --> 00:00:19.182
It is so deep that humans, who live on land in the Upper World, can never visit.

5
00:00:19.183 --> 00:00:24.058
In the Sea Kingdom, blue water covers everything.

6
00:00:24.059 --> 00:00:28.020
The water there moves like the waves above.

7
00:00:28.021 --> 00:00:34.451
When the ocean is calm, the sun's rays reach down to this deep place.

8
00:00:34.452 --> 00:00:42.598
And on a still night, the moon and stars send pale light sparkling down through the water.

9
00:00:42.599 --> 00:00:46.856
The most beautiful trees grow at the bottom of the sea.

10
00:00:46.857 --> 00:00:50.815
Some have purple branches and blue leaves.

11
00:00:50.816 --> 00:00:55.418
There are gardens with many brightly colored flowers too.

12
00:00:55.419 --> 00:01:01.565
The plants all move slowly back and forth with each ripple of the water.

13
00:01:01.566 --> 00:01:08.268
Many kinds of fish, large and small, swim among the leaves and the flowers.

14
00:01:08.269 --> 00:01:12.611
They play all day and sleep among the rocks.

15
00:01:12.612 --> 00:01:19.454
Sea folk live in the Sea Kingdom, and they are called mermaids and mermen.

16
00:01:19.455 --> 00:01:23.342
They love to swim and play tag with the fish.

17
00:01:23.343 --> 00:01:28.188
The mermaids also love to feed the fish from their pretty hands.

18
00:01:28.189 --> 00:01:34.562
Like their fish friends, the mermaids and mermen have tails to help them swim.

19
00:01:34.563 --> 00:01:39.211
The sea folk love the ocean and everything in it.

20
00:01:39.212 --> 00:01:42.752
They would never want to live anywhere else.

21
00:01:42.753 --> 00:01:48.083
And they live a very long time, about three hundred years.

22
00:01:48.084 --> 00:01:54.402
The sea folk are happy to spend their days singing and playing in the gardens.

23
00:01:54.403 --> 00:02:00.978
A long time ago, a king lived in a palace at the deepest part of the sea.

24
00:02:00.979 --> 00:02:05.817
He lived with his six young daughters, the mermaid princesses.

25
00:02:05.818 --> 00:02:10.079
His palace had walls of bright orange coral.

26
00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:13.318
Black mussels covered the roof.

27
00:02:13.319 --> 00:02:18.058
Their shells opened and closed with the changing of the tide.

28
00:02:18.059 --> 00:02:23.748
When each shell was open, a silver pearl twinkled from within.

29
00:02:23.749 --> 00:02:29.378
The Sea King was kind and ruled over all the beings living underwater.

30
00:02:29.379 --> 00:02:34.394
He loved to make them happy, but he lived with a broken heart.

31
00:02:34.395 --> 00:02:41.694
"How sad that my wife, the Queen, died many years ago." He sighed.

32
00:02:41.695 --> 00:02:48.109
"Now I care for the six mermaid princesses all by myself."

33
00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:53.475
"Oh no, you don't," said his mother, the Wise Mermaid.

34
00:02:53.476 --> 00:02:56.656
"I'm the one who takes care of them.

35
00:02:56.657 --> 00:03:01.381
And I make sure the palace is clean and tidy too.

36
00:03:01.382 --> 00:03:07.288
Son, you always forget about everything I do around here!"

37
00:03:07.289 --> 00:03:12.133
"You are right, Mother," said the Sea King with a smile.

38
00:03:12.134 --> 00:03:15.708
"This family is very lucky to have you."

39
00:03:15.709 --> 00:03:19.467
The Wise Mermaid knew a lot about the world.

40
00:03:19.468 --> 00:03:22.343
And she taught her granddaughters well.

41
00:03:22.344 --> 00:03:31.729
"When you are ready," she always told the princesses, "I will teach you about life above the sea."

42
00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:35.594
The sisters were each born one year apart.

43
00:03:35.595 --> 00:03:42.591
When each sister turned 15, she would be allowed to swim up to the sea surface.

44
00:03:42.592 --> 00:03:48.241
Then the mermaid princess would see the Upper World for the first time.

45
00:03:48.242 --> 00:03:53.334
The mermaid princesses were happy with their simple lives in the Sea Kingdom.

46
00:03:53.335 --> 00:03:57.462
Every one of their days was spent in fun and laughter.

47
00:03:57.463 --> 00:04:00.763
But the youngest princess was different.

48
00:04:00.764 --> 00:04:05.725
She was quiet, thoughtful—a bit unusual.

49
00:04:05.726 --> 00:04:16.261
Because she was the youngest and the smallest, they called her the Little Mermaid.

